ent Chat in a portal#Customize the Agent Chat button#About this task#{4}":[158,159],"#Configure Agent Chat in a portal#Customize the Agent Chat button#About this task#{5}":[160,163],"#Configure Agent Chat in a portal#Customize the Agent Chat button#Procedure":[164,411],"#Configure Agent Chat in a portal#Customize the Agent Chat button#Procedure#{1}":[166,167],"#Configure Agent Chat in a portal#Customize the Agent Chat button#Procedure#{2}":[168,169],"#Configure Agent Chat in a portal#Customize the Agent Chat button#Procedure#{3}":[170,171],"#Configure Agent Chat in a portal#Customize the Agent Chat button#Procedure#{4}":[172,186],"#Configure Agent Chat in a portal#Customize the Agent Chat button#Procedure#{5}":[187,187],"#Configure Agent Chat in a portal#Customize the Agent Chat button#Procedure#{6}":[188,411]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Service Portal","target":"c_ServicePortal","line":38},{"title":"Create a portal","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-user-interface/service-portal/create-a-portal.md","line":140},{"title":"Storing images in the database","target":"c_StoringImagesInTheDatabase","line":148},{"title":"configure","target":"configure-onboarding-modals","line":154},{"title":"reference","target":"onboarding-modals-reference","line":187},{"title":"Approvals widget","target":"approvals-widget","line":285},{"title":"Service Portal configuration page","target":"service-portal-configuration-page","line":362},{"title":"Storing images in the database","target":"c_StoringImagesInTheDatabase","line":405},{"title":"Service Portal","target":"c_ServicePortal","line":406},{"title":"Configure","target":"configure-onboarding-modals","line":407},{"title":"Reference","target":"onboarding-modals-reference","line":408},{"title":"Approvals widget","target":"approvals-widget","line":409},{"title":"Service Portal configuration page","target":"service-portal-configuration-page","line":410}],"metadata":{"title":"Configure Agent Chat in a portal","description":"Your end users can initiate and maintain an Agent Chat conversation in any portal page. Write a script to pass portal-specific data to Agent Chat. For example, pass the name of your knowledge base to a Virtual Agent conversation.You can change the color and images that are used in the Agent Chat button in your portal.If you are upgrading from a previous release, your portal implementation may include the Virtual Agent Service Portal widget. Migrate widget options to the Agent Chat in Service Portal configuration and remove all instances of the widget to enable your users to initiate and maintain an Agent Chat conversation in any portal page. Use the spContextManager class in a widget client script to pass dynamic page data to Agent Chat. For example, pass the number of approvals in the Approvals widget to Agent Chat when a user initiates a conversation from the Service Portal homepage.If your portal includes a Live Chat link in the header menu, you can remove it by updating the widget's option schema.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/platform-user-interface/service-portal/configure-va-in-sp.html","release":"australia","product":"Service Portal","classification":"service-portal","topic_type":"task","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":8,"keywords":["Configure","Agent Chat","portal","Virtual Agent","com.glide.interaction.awa","AWA","Advanced Work Assignment"],"breadcrumb":["Create a portal","Configuring Service Portal","Service Portal","Configure UIs and portals","Configure user experiences"],"tags":["#platform-user-interface","#service-portal","#widgets","#themes","#self-service","#type-task","#ff0000"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[122,128],[190,206],[220,256],[258,270],[276,305],[312,332],[337,370],[375,379]]},"smart_blocks:ServiceNowOfficialDocs/platform-user-interface/service-portal/configure-va-in-sp.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":